window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Mother, Mother, Meat concludes the Hanging Hill Lane story, the final part in a dark and bloody fantasy horror set in modern-day Cornwall.</p> <p>Following on from the events that ended book two, The Third Hunter, the finale takes Daphne through more torment and through the depths of her mind looking for a way to win.<br> <br> Although you do not have to have listened to book one, The House on Hanging Hill Lane, to follow this book, listening to The Third Hunter first is a must.</p>"; 
